sequenceDiagram
    participant App
    participant SS as SecureStore
    participant KS as Keystore
    participant Blob as DataStore

    App->>SS: put("refresh", token)
    SS->>KS: getOrCreate AES key alias
    SS->>KS: Cipher.init ENCRYPT (key stays in hardware)
    KS-->>SS: cipher + IV
    SS->>Blob: store IV + ciphertext
    App->>SS: get("refresh")
    SS->>Blob: read IV + ciphertext
    SS->>KS: Cipher.init DECRYPT with IV
    KS-->>SS: plaintext token
    SS-->>App: token
